  "text": "@Lumie_lights @ippodo_tea_jp @jump_ropes @XeroShoesEU 7. @Loveramics BOND Mug\nPrior only sold commercially not to consumers directly. They just opened a EU distribution. Fell in love with this cup in local cafe.Picked 2 up recently. They are super thick, retain all the heat, have a spherical bottom and feel great to the touch. https://t.co/dYK8paqM8C",
